' The start screen by keys (`menu seed 3`). The first Enter only shows the
' selection, on the first player's slot; Enter again opens it (a face, the
' name field); a name is typed; Shift+Right gives the next face; Down goes to
' the difficulty, Right to the game mode, and Enter turns it to Classic; Up
' back to the slot, Up to START, and Enter starts a v1.2 Classic game.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
press enter              ' the selection shows
press enter              ' the first slot: in use
type Anna
press shift+right        ' the next face
press down               ' the difficulty
press right              ' the game mode
press enter              ' Classic
press up                 ' the first slot
press up                 ' START
press enter
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 10
quit
